- How would you ensure thread-safety and hot-swapping of formatters in a multi-threaded or serverless environment?
- How would you test new formatters without changing logger core code?

## Why This Is Asked

Shows ability to design a pluggable, runtime-extensible validation system that minimizes gateway churn while supporting new rules added at runtime. Emphasizes clean interfaces and parallel execution semantics.

